{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23882","headline":"劝酒十四首 不如来饮酒七首 六 · 白居易","name":"劝酒十四首 不如来饮酒七首 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫上青云去，青云足爱憎。\n自贤夸智慧，相糺鬬功能。\n鱼烂缘吞饵，蛾燋爲扑灯。\n不如来饮酒，任性醉腾腾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23882.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23882","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}